# landing_rise_est_high.scn — a LANDING that begins before the support thrust is calibrated, with the hover-thrust estimate 28 % too high (noise n2): the craft does not rise again
#                             サポート推力が較正される前に始まる LANDING、ホバー推力の見積もりが 28 % 高い（ノイズ n2）: 機体は再上昇しない
#
# With `hover.thrust_corr 1.2` the hover-thrust estimate is about 28 % above the thrust that holds the craft, and the closed-loop landing started from that estimate: before the accelerometer calibration of the support
# thrust (2 s of near-hover samples) nothing would bound that base without the bound below, and the craft that was commanded to descend would RISE from 1.19 m to 1.98 m (the ceiling of the ToF range), then fall in the descent without a ToF and touch
# down at 2.20 m/s (the truth vertical speed at the first contact with the floor, altitude below 3 cm; the descent_speed_max of the metric below is the same quantity). Spec under test (landingBaseThrust(), brakeRiseInLanding(); detailed_design.md §3.1):
#  1. The base of the landing is bounded by the support reference (kLandingBaseOverSupportMax x the early estimate) also before the calibration.
#  2. While the craft rises in the LANDING, the thrust is limited to a falling fraction of the support reference (rise brake): the altitude after the LANDING began stays within the take-off overshoot.
#  3. The ToF stays in range (no descent without a ToF), the touchdown is gentle and the motors stop on the floor.
#
# `hover.thrust_corr 1.2` では、ホバー推力の見積もりが機体を支える推力より約 28 % 高く、閉ループの着陸がその見積もりから始まり、支持推力の加速度計による較正（ホバー近傍の 2 s）の前は
# 下の上限が無ければその基準を抑えるものが無く、降下を指令された機体が 1.19 m から 1.98 m（ToF の測れる上限）まで「上昇」し、その後 ToF なしの降下で落ちて 2.20 m/s（真値の鉛直速度の、床への最初の接触の瞬間 = 高さ 3 cm 未満の値。下の metric の descent_speed_max も同じ量）で接地する。検証する仕様
# （landingBaseThrust()、brakeRiseInLanding()。detailed_design.md §3.1）:
#  1. 着陸の基準は、較正の前にも、支持推力の基準（kLandingBaseOverSupportMax × 早い推定）で抑えられる。
#  2. LANDING 中に機体が上昇するあいだ、推力は支持推力の基準の（下がる）割合以下に制限される（上昇ブレーキ）: LANDING が始まった後の高度は、離陸の行き過ぎの範囲に収まる。
#  3. ToF は測れる範囲に残り（ToF なしの降下にならない）、接地は穏やかで、モータは床の上で止まる。
#
# Run: sf sils scenario simulator/sils/scenarios/landing_rise_est_high.scn --target vehicle --duration 28000000 --noise n2
#
#  <t>  ch        <thr> <roll> <pitch> <yaw> <arm> <hold_ms> <rate_hz>
   0    param      hover.thrust_corr 1.2                                                 # P: hover-thrust estimate 1.2 x mg against the true value
   0    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # A: boot at rest — calibration completes
   +    api        "command"                                                            # B: API command mode
   +    api        "takeoff"                                                            # C: auto-takeoff to 0.5 m (the overshoot peaks near 1.2 m with the estimate 28 % high)
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # D: hold — FLYING
   +    api        "land"                                                               # E: land (12 s): LANDING begins before the support thrust is calibrated
   +    rc         2048  2048   2048    2048  0     6000      50                       # F: descent and touchdown
